    "reason": "The patch, validation, complete title/body and prefilled comparison are ready. Craft PR creation remains blocked by the previously reported API 403 and automatic approval-review rejection; neither denied action was retried.",
    "base": "main",
    "head": "Afloat16:bugfix/r3.12-go-buildinfo-diagnostics-20261111",
    "commit": "8779ef0f251418d1007e475590bb9cb7326d5ce6",
    "prefill_url": "https://github.com/storytold/craft-anything/compare/main...Afloat16:bugfix/r3.12-go-buildinfo-diagnostics-20261111?expand=1&title=Bound%20repeated%20Go%20build%20information%20diagnostics%20%28R3.12%29&body=%23%23%20Problem%0A%0AEvery%20aligned%2C%20pointer-encoded%20Go%20build%20information%20candidate%20with%20an%20unreadable%20version%20pointer%20appends%20the%20same%20owned%20diagnostic%20string.%20A%20damaged%20region%20can%20therefore%20retain%20hundreds%20of%20thousands%20of%20identical%20strings%20while%20the%20reader%20continues%20looking%20for%20valid%20metadata.%20The%20whole-file%20fallback%20can%20probe%20the%20same%20offsets%20again.%0A%0A%23%23%20Change%0A%0ACount%20these%20failed%20probes%20locally%20and%20emit%20one%20diagnostic%20after%20each%20candidate%20scan.%20A%20single%20failure%20keeps%20its%20exact%20existing%20text%3B%20repeated%20failures%20retain%20the%20specific%20reason%20and%20count.%20The%20count%20explicitly%20describes%20probes%20in%20that%20scan%2C%20rather%20than%20unique%20file%20offsets.%0A%0AThe%20scan%20still%20reaches%20later%20readable%20inline%20or%20pointer-encoded%20build%20information.%20Module%20diagnostics%2C%20address%20mapping%2C%20function%20decoding%2C%20input%20limits%20and%20the%20public%20API%20remain%20unchanged.%20There%20is%20no%20new%20dependency.%0A%0AThe%20public%20R3.12%20claim%20is%20commit%20%60ace2048a1d6e9424bf5aa31e399119cabdb63659%60%2C%20before%20implementation.%20ROADMAP%20and%20STATUS%20record%20the%20completed%20work%20and%20evidence.%0A%0A%23%23%20Regression%20and%20native%20evidence%0A%0A-%20Six%20permanent%20integration%20tests%20cover%20ordinary%20metadata%2C%20exact%20single-failure%20wording%2C%20repeated%20failures%20before%20valid%20inline%20metadata%2C%20fallback%20rescanning%20without%20valid%20metadata%2C%2032%2F64-bit%20pointer%20metadata%20in%20both%20byte%20orders%2C%20and%20invalid-width%2Funaligned%20controls.%20Against%20original%20%603ce1ce9f%60%2C%20two%20controls%20pass%20and%20four%20bounded-diagnostic%20cases%20fail%3B%20the%20fixed%20implementation%20passes%20all%20six.%0A-%20Go%201.24.13%20compiles%20an%20original%20owned%20program.%20Native%20%60debug%2Fbuildinfo.ReadFile%60%20agrees%20on%20the%20original%20and%20relocated%20complete%20controls%3B%20%60go%20tool%20nm%60%20verifies%20the%20original%20%60main.main%60%20and%20%60main.retained%60%20addresses%20in%20each%20generated%20image.%0A-%20The%20stress%20image%20places%20262%2C144%20unreadable%20pointer%20headers%20in%20an%208%20MiB%20region%20before%20the%20byte-identical%20native%20build%20information%20block.%20Both%20reader%20versions%20recover%20identical%20complete%20metadata%20and%20all%201%2C786%20decoded%20functions.%20Every%20report%20field%20other%20than%20the%20intentionally%20aggregated%20top-level%20diagnostic%20is%20compared%20directly%2C%20with%20matching%20full-report%20hashes.%0A-%20Ordinary%20control%20reports%2C%20including%20diagnostics%2C%20remain%20identical.%20The%20native%20Go%20reader%20is%20used%20for%20the%20complete%20controls%3B%20it%20is%20not%20claimed%20to%20accept%20a%20damaged%20prefix%20or%20to%20execute%20the%20transformed%20images.%0A%0A%23%23%20Measured%20retention%0A%0AActual%20public%20%60go%3A%3Ainspect%60%20calls%20run%20in%20fresh%20processes%20under%20identical%20optimized%20Rust%201.99.0%20builds%2C%20with%20only%20%60go.rs%60%20swapped%20between%20original%20and%20fixed%20code.%20Release%20LTO%20is%20disabled%2C%20codegen-units%20is%2016%20and%20debug%20information%20is%20disabled%20in%20both%20builds.%0A%0A%7C%208%20MiB%20repeated-header%20fixture%20%7C%20Original%20peak%20RSS%2C%20KiB%20%7C%20Fixed%20peak%20RSS%2C%20KiB%20%7C%0A%7C%20---%20%7C%20---%3A%20%7C%20---%3A%20%7C%0A%7C%20Process%201%20%7C%2047%2C620%20%7C%2014%2C160%20%7C%0A%7C%20Process%202%20%7C%2047%2C504%20%7C%2014%2C224%20%7C%0A%7C%20Process%203%20%7C%2047%2C504%20%7C%2014%2C124%20%7C%0A%7C%20Median%20%7C%2047%2C504%20%7C%2014%2C160%20%7C%0A%0AMedian%20peak%20RSS%20falls%20%2A%2A70.2%25%20on%20this%20bounded%20fixture%2A%2A.%20There%20are%20twelve%20measured%20processes%20in%20total%2C%20including%20the%20original%2C%20relocated%20and%20single-failure%20controls%20for%20both%20builds.%20This%20is%20repeated-diagnostic%20aggregation%2C%20not%20a%20reduced%20scan%20limit%20or%20omitted%20metadata.%0A%0A%23%23%20Validation%0A%0A%5BFull%20validation%20at%20%60da3e2b1%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FAfloat16%2Fbillion-context%2Factions%2Fruns%2F43069839827%2Fjob%2F130694422683%29%3A%0A%0A-%20Complete%20formats%20suite%3A%20%2A%2A1%2C711%20passed%2C%200%20failed%2C%2010%20ignored%2A%2A%20across%20208%20test%20targets.%0A-%20Rust%201.99.0%20formatting%2C%20strict%20all-target%20formats%20Clippy%2C%20layers%2C%20locks%20and%20secrets%20passed.%0A-%20The%20complete%20five-crate%20WebAssembly%20gate%20passed.%0A-%20Original%2Ffixed%20comparisons%2C%20native%20controls%2C%20fresh-process%20measurements%20and%20a%20clean%20checkout%20passed.%0A%0A%5BFinal%20source%20identity%20and%20documentation%20checks%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FAfloat16%2Fbillion-context%2Factions%2Fruns%2F43071242390%29%20verify%20that%20final%20%608779ef0%60%20changes%20only%20ROADMAP%20and%20STATUS%20relative%20to%20the%20fully%20tested%20implementation%2C%20retaining%20the%20entire%20product%2Ftest%2Fdependency%20tree%20and%20the%20claim-before-code%20ancestry.%0A%0ATwo%20earlier%20validation%20runs%20stopped%20while%20constructing%20the%20native%20ELF%20fixture%2C%20before%20any%20product%20tests%3A%20%5Bfirst%20attempt%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FAfloat16%2Fbillion-context%2Factions%2Fruns%2F43068899521%29%2C%20%5Bsecond%20attempt%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FAfloat16%2Fbillion-context%2Factions%2Fruns%2F43069518509%29.%20The%20corrected%20fixture%20relocates%20the%20whole%20program-header%20table%20instead%20of%20treating%20zero%20section-header%20bytes%20as%20free%20space.%20Those%20failures%20remain%20recorded.%0A"
